  and `PieceChart`) stay there; this section uses none of them.
* Two pieces only; the family form (`ManyPiece`) is in `Causal.CBG.Maximal`.
* The uniqueness step of `isCauchySurface` does not follow Sbierski: two points of `S` on one
  causal curve are related in `P`, hence in `A` (`le_of_le_top`), where `S` is acausal.

